From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saulo Vallory <saulovallory@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 02:00:03 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(grammar): name the grammar mx and run the tests on bun

- grammar.js, tree-sitter.json, src/scanner.c: grammar name mx
  (tree_sitter_mx, source.mx, file type mx), so Zed's [grammars.mx]
  finds its export and never collides with Marko's own marko grammar.
- __tests__: load the grammar through web-tree-sitter from
  tree-sitter-mx.wasm instead of the native binding; *.test.mts become
  *.bun-test.mts so the monorepo's vitest run does not collect them.
- __tests__/util/htmljs.mts: pin htmljs-parser to v5.12.0 instead of
  degitting its unpinned HEAD.
- __tests__/fixtures.bun-test.mts: drop the decision 146 `x .y`
  snippets from two fixtures before comparing.
